      "text": "will commune with thee from above the mercy seat, Ex. 25:22. made the ark of shittim wood, Ex. 37:1. put therein the ark of the testimony, Ex. 40:3. their charge shall be the ark, Num. 3:31. ark of the covenant … went before them, Num. 10:33. book of the law, and put it in … the ark, Deut. 31:26. When ye see the ark of the covenant, Josh. 3:3 (3:3–17). waters of Jordan were cut off before the ark, Josh. 4:7. Take up the ark of the covenant, Josh. 6:6. Let us fetch the ark … out of Shiloh, 1 Sam. 4:3. Philistines have brought again the ark, 1 Sam. 6:21. fetched up the ark of the Lord, 1 Sam. 7:1. brought up the ark … into the city of David, 2 Sam. 6:12. nothing in the ark save the two tables, 1 Kgs. 8:9. let us bring again the ark of our God, 1 Chr. 13:3. prepared a place for the ark of God, 1 Chr. 15:1. ark of God, and set it in the midst, 1 Chr. 16:1. build ye the sanctuary … to bring the ark of the covenant, 1 Chr. 22:19. to bring up the ark of the covenant, 2 Chr. 5:2. they shall say no more, The ark of the covenant, Jer. 3:16.",
